          "settings": {
            "title": "When will my equipment be delivered?",
            "copy": "<p>Preparation time varies by product. Check the processing time shown on the product page or contact us to confirm the timing for your order.</p><p>Within 100 miles of Benicia, CA 94510, parcel and freight items are delivered in 1–2 business days once ready. This delivery window begins when the equipment is ready, not when you place the order.</p><p>Assembly and installation appointments are confirmed separately. For other destinations, see our <a href=\"https://www.fitnesssuperstore.com/pages/shipping-information\" title=\"Shipping Information\">Shipping Information</a> page.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_rrw7HN": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which delivery service should I choose?",
            "copy": "<p>Delivery options depend on the equipment and destination. Choose the service offered for your item.</p><ul><li><strong>Curbside delivery:</strong> Equipment is delivered to the closest accessible curbside area. You handle movement beyond curbside, unpacking and packaging disposal. Assembly is not included.</li><li><strong>Garage delivery, no unpacking:</strong> Equipment is left in its crate in the garage. Confirm driveway and pallet-jack access before booking. You handle unpacking, packaging disposal and movement beyond the garage.</li><li><strong>Room-of-choice delivery / assembly:</strong> Your purchased service determines placement, unpacking, assembly and packaging removal. Provide the room location, doorway and path measurements, stairs and access photos before booking.</li><li><strong>Parcel delivery:</strong> Smaller eligible items travel by parcel carrier or local vehicle. Assembly is not included.</li></ul><p>Review the delivery and selected service charges at checkout. Contact us before ordering if you are unsure which service fits your equipment or access requirements. Do not assume assembly or room-of-choice service is included with free delivery.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
