        "accordion_rrw7HN"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "title": "Local Delivery in Northern California",
        "copy": "<p><strong>Free Local Delivery on Eligible $1,000+ Orders</strong></p><p>Fitness Superstore offers free local delivery on eligible orders of $1,000 or more to approved delivery ZIP codes within approximately 100 miles of 94510. Eligibility is determined at checkout using the delivery ZIP and qualifying cart subtotal. Addresses outside the approved ZIP list, and orders below the qualifying subtotal, use the available paid delivery options shown at checkout.<br/><br/>Assembly, installation, room-of-choice upgrades and other additional services are separate unless expressly included in your approved order or a separately approved offer.<br/><br/>For delivery services, transit estimates and receiving instructions, see our <a href=\"https://www.fitnesssuperstore.com/pages/shipping-information\" title=\"https://www.fitnesssuperstore.com/pages/shipping-information\">Shipping Information </a>page.</p>"
